@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Study Better - Home";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Study Better Layout</title>
    <style>
        .container, .container-fluid {
            max-width: 100% !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
            padding: 0 !important;
        }

        /* Make all sections flush left */
        section, div {
            text-align: left;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
            /* background: #02091C; */
            color: white;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background: #01B697;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .translation {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: black;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Logo + tagline row */
        .logo-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: #6D6D6D;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            flex: 0 0 250px;
            background: #D9D9D9;
            height: 200px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: black;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .tagline {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: white;
            margin-left: 2rem;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }

            .hero h1 {
                font-family: "ADLaM Display", cursive;
                font-size: 3rem;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }

            .hero p {
                max-width: 900px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }

        /* Three demographic blocks */
        .blocks {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .block {
            flex: 1 1 300px;
            background: #D9D9D9;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }

            .block h2 {
                color: black;
                font-size: 1.5rem;
                margin-top: 1rem;
            }

            .block p {
                color: black;
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .block button {
                margin-top: 1rem;
                padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
                font-size: 1rem;
                border: none;
                border-radius: 6px;
                background: #D9D9D9;
                color: black;
                cursor: pointer;
                box-shadow: 0 6px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #01B697;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="translation">Translation button</div>
        <nav>
            <span>Select few | menu Items | will go here</span>
            <span>Dropdown for rest</span>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="logo-row">
        <div class="logo">Logo</div>
        <div class="tagline">The tagline underneath the logo but really big to fill the space in a good way</div>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome</h1>
        <p>Introductory paragraph about the agency and what you offer so the client understands somewhat of what the purpose of the agency is and therefore can make an informed choice about which demographic their needs fall into.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="blocks">
        <div class="block" style="background:#2B74DD">
            <div class="photo" style="width: 392px; height: 259px">Photo relevant to the everyman</div>
            <h2>Targeting private demographic</h2>
            <button>Button link</button>
        </div>
        <div class="block" style="background:#E3AF20">
            <div class="photo" style="width: 392px; height: 259px">Appeal to corporate with professional image</div>
            <h2>Targeting Companies</h2>
            <button>To go to the</button>
        </div>
        <div class="block" style="background:#E86666">
            <div class="photo" style="width: 392px; height: 259px" >Government related image</div>
            <h2>Target Government</h2>
            <button>Desired page</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        Footer with relevant info
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
